of both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x}) \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡y & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we differentiate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡y) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =(\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}\\operatorname{sec}⁡x)\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x(\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we solve for $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =y(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\,\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x}{x})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute $y={x}^{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & ={x}^{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x}\\cdot (\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\,\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+\\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x}{x}) \\\\  & ={x}^{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x}{x}\\cdot (x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1) \\\\  & ={x}^{\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-1}\\operatorname{sec}⁡x\\cdot (x\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x+1).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a32a9416-0150-598e-ac86-6202b9e0f123"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a32a9416-0150-598e-ac86-6202b9e0f123" :answer-field/id #uuid "a32a9416-0150-598e-ac86-6202b9e0f123" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-016328d0-e890-5f0f-acd5-5481d9b4f783" :answer-field/choices ["answer-016328d